    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic and simple Spider Solitaire card game, just like the one you'll find built-in to Windows.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels: \u2660\ufe0f, \u2660\ufe0f+\u2665, \u2660\ufe0f+\u2665+\u2663+\u2666.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable themes: Theme color changes with selectable card-back and background images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical items: Extra Slot, Force Move, and Swap Card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking: Compete with players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth gameplay: Single-click dragging, double-click fast moves, keyboard/gamepad support, and built-in key remapping options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto save/load: Quit and return at anytime you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undo &amp; redo: Full undo &amp; redo capabilities even if you quit game in the middle! No penalty if all undo moves are recovered with redo moves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge high score players: Can you beat the high scores with the same card set?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch replay and beat it: You can replay any game you ever played and try it over &amp; over again. Never give up on a promising game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: The game will never finish until you empty the bottom right pile of cards. Hit your best score with no limits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss mode: You can play this game safely in this mode even if your boss comes around frequently!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Score: Flip Streak, Collecting Cards Right After Issuing, Collecting Cards In Row...Every hardcore operation brings you extra bonus score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Player: Play or pause, playing in different modes like loop, shuffle, or play in order.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic and simple Spider Solitaire card game, just like the one you'll find built-in to Windows.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels: \u2660\ufe0f, \u2660\ufe0f+\u2665, \u2660\ufe0f+\u2665+\u2663+\u2666.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable themes: Theme color changes with selectable card-back and background images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical items: Extra Slot, Force Move, and Swap Card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking: Compete with players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth gameplay: Single-click dragging, double-click fast moves, keyboard/gamepad support, and built-in key remapping options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto save/load: Quit and return at anytime you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undo &amp; redo: Full undo &amp; redo capabilities even if you quit game in the middle! No penalty if all undo moves are recovered with redo moves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge high score players: Can you beat the high scores with the same card set?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch replay and beat it: You can replay any game you ever played and try it over &amp; over again. Never give up on a promising game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: The game will never finish until you empty the bottom right pile of cards. Hit your best score with no limits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss mode: You can play this game safely in this mode even if your boss comes around frequently!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Score: Flip Streak, Collecting Cards Right After Issuing, Collecting Cards In Row...Every hardcore operation brings you extra bonus score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Player: Play or pause, playing in different modes like loop, shuffle, or play in order.</p></li></ul>",
